claude.description:
Sends voice tasks to a running Claude Code session, e.g. "Alexa, ask Schlaufuchs, Claude soll ...". The Echo that asked speaks Claude's answer; long answers also go to the phone.

Only assigned Echos (see Echo assignment) selected here may send tasks. The "Claude bridge" switch turns it off at any time.

